Cₖ (S − hₖ) = Cₖ₊₁ (S − hₖ₊₂), with Cₖ = Tₖ × Tₖ₊₁
— a two-step linear recurrence. It drives the curvature difference at all 51 joins to exactly zero. The chain is genuinely G2, not nearly.
